cessus est plus rapide pour certains que d'autres ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.997084548104956,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EnduForce_600_2","description":"Séance d'endurance de force en **deux blocs**. Il y a 3 intervalles par bloc, respectivement de **35\", 25\" et 15\"**, séparés par 3' de repos courues très lentement et/ou marchées. À la fin du premier bloc, après le dernier sprint de 15\", prends 5' *(soit 2' de bonus !)* puis repars sur le second bloc avec autant d'intensité que sur le premier.","displayName":"Endurance de Force","coachAdvice":"Le but est d'imposer à ton corps des contraintes mécaniques élevées (impact). Mais cela ne doit jamais déclencher de douleur / en aggraver. Prends ton temps à l'échauffement, puis sur les premiers intervalles pour te permettre de t'exprimer pleinement sur les sprints suivants.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_35","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":35,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":180,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_25","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":25,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3.2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":180,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"FORCE_15","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.98033788700312,"expectedDuration":3270},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":35,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":25,"pace":{"value":192}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":180,"pace":{"value":599}}