40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Cette fois, c'est sûr, le footing ça doit définitivement être devenu ta sortie la plus agréable ! Avec la forme qui monte tu dois te sentir pousser des ailes lors de tes footings non ? Si c'est le cas... retiens-toi, garde cette allure lente où tu es en total contrôle, on est pile dans la bonne zone de travail !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"VMA_600_2","description":"Classique séance de VMA, le 30/30 c'est l'enchaînement de 30\" à ton allure VMA (calculée par nos soins) suivies de 30\" de footing lent. Au total, tu enchaînes 10 fois les 30\" rapides et 30\" lentes.","displayName":"Vitesse Maximale Aérobie (VMA)","coachAdvice":"Ne va pas trop vite sur les premiers intervalles. Il vaut mieux être un peu en retard le temps de trouver ton rythme. Les intervalles en fin de séance sont souvent plus longs qu'on ne le pense ! Et ça sera d'autant plus long si tu as gaspillé ton énergie sur les premiers intervalles. Savoir gérer ton effort est une compétence importante à acquérir en tant que coureur(se).","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":10,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"VMA_0.5","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VMA","value":212,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"vma"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.180764797173554,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":212}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":30,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_70","description":"Sortie longue à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale, comme pour les footings.","displayName":"Sortie Longue","coachAdvice":"Une autre \"petite\" balade de 1h10. On sait que ça parait peu pour toi... Le fait est qu'en dehors d'une préparation spécifique semi ou marathon... pas besoin d'en faire beaucoup plus, on se concentre sur les entraînements du coeur de la semaine !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_70","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":70,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":6,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a689a00ba63bbdf0cadd5d0","userId":"642ab60364