être à 100% sur la séance d'intensité suivante... et donc minimiser les progrès de celle-ci ! (je me répète, mais c'est important !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1789948800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.9178885630498534,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_6","description":"Séance de seuil 60' où tu vas enchaîner **7 répétitions de 4'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 2' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 60","coachAdvice":"On connait la musique, sur le premier intervalle ça va, le 2ème faut commencer à forcer, le 3ème va déjà te sembler long, le 4ème est difficile... et ensuite, comme souvent, tout au mental, ne lâche rien !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":7,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil60"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":595,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":tru