ration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"On fait tourner les jambes, sans jamais forcer, l'objectif est clair cette semaine : récupérer avant d'attaquer un nouveau cycle d'entraînement !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.0588235294117645,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Footing / lignes droites, c'est un classique des coureurs ! Ça ne fatigue pas mais ça permet de garder le corps en mode \"entraînement\". Pas de rythmes précis sur les lignes droites, vas y progressivement, selon tes sensations !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":190,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":593,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.928996183544865,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":325}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":593}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":59