"duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Le footing, c'est l'entraînement où tu dois être \"facile\", en totale aisance respiratoire pour être dans la bonne zone de travail et que ce soit efficace, ne l'oublie jamais ! Courir trop vite en footing est l'erreur la plus courante et souvent un des freins majeurs de la progression !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1792368000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.0588235294117645,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":325}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Affutage_10_600_S1_ HARD2","description":"Séance d'allure spécifique 10 km avec **3 intervalles de 7'** à ton allure 10 km entrecoupés de 4' de récupération.","displayName":"Allure 10 km","coachAdvice":"Il n’y a que 3 fractions dans cette séance, mais elle n’est pas facile pour autant. Surtout que l’allure 10 km peut sembler « relativement » facile en début de séance (comme en début de course !), donc reste bien concentré pour ne pas te laisser influencer par cette sensation de pouvoir courir plus vite.\nRappelle-toi que l’objectif est que la dernière série soit aussi bien maîtrisée que la première. Pas question de finir à genoux parce que tu auras tout donné : sur les séances à allure spécifique, tu dois rester en contrôle. Si ce n’est pas le cas, c’est probablement que l’allure est trop rapide.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"A10_7","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"10km","value":244,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"10km"},"durations":[{"value":7,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_4","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1792368000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":12.575699132111861,"expectedD